From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Borodin <hatemosphere@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:00:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(parser): fail on deep nesting instead of overflowing the
 stack

Port of https://github.com/boa-dev/boa/pull/5675.

The libc dependency goes into the normalized crates.io Cargo.toml as a [target.cfg(any(linux, apple)).dependencies.libc] version = "0.2" table instead of a workspace dependency; Windows declares GetCurrentThreadStackLimits itself, so no windows-sys.

Left out, outside the crate: Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml.
---
 Cargo.toml               |   3 ++
 src/lib.rs               |   1 +
 src/parser/cursor/mod.rs |  15 +++++-
 src/parser/tests/mod.rs  |  38 +++++++++++++++
 src/stack.rs             | 103 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 158 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/stack.rs

